sed C's attention skills (excellent attention skills) which is a strength. That could further support C. We could ask Agent 1 for more info on C's stress resilience or technical competence. But we can also incorporate that we have that fact (excellent attention skills) not yet discussed.\n\nThus we can change vote to Candidate C, referencing Agent 1's points and adding that C also has excellent attention skills, which addresses attention criterion. Also note that C's communication difficulty is a concern but may be mitigated.\n\nThus we will produce a public message: we agree with Agent 1, shift vote to C, mention D's weak leadership and moody, and note C's reliability, positive crew atmosphere, decision speed, and excellent attention skills. Provide implication.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
